ndary_7", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Verbs with Infinitives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "After some verbs, you use the Infinitive structure (to + verb), like <span class=\"italic\">want to go</span> or <span class=\"italic\">would like to swim</span> to express a goal, a purpose, or a preference.<br/><br/>Here is a list of verbs you use with Infinitives:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Verb</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Example</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"want to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">I want to have pizza.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"like to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">I like to play soccer. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">I have to buy dinner. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"prefer to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">I prefer to drink milkshakes.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"need to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">I need to go to my yoga class. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: What do you need to do? <br/> <span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: I have to go to the supermarket.<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: Would you like to go shopping? <br/> <span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: I would prefer to stay at home."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pepperoni"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a type of spicy sausage used on pizza"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I would like extra pepperoni on my pizza."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when you talk about food."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cheese"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a solid food made from milk"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The 4 cheese pizza is delicious."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "vegetarian"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who doesn't eat meat"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I don't eat pepperoni. I am a vegetarian."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "vegetables"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "plants that people eat"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I would like extra vegetables on my pizza."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "meat"}, {"type"